flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B{ROM table loaded}

    B -- Yes --> C([Return])

    B -- No --> D[Open preferences namespace rom_table read only]
    D --> E[Initialize index i to 0]

    E --> F{Index less than 14}

    F -- Yes --> G[Load ROM entry for index i]
    G --> H[Convert ROM entry to uppercase]
    H --> I[Trim whitespace from ROM entry]
    I --> J[Increment index i]
    J --> F

    F -- No --> K[Close preferences]
    K --> L[Set ROM table loaded flag]
    L --> M([End])
